---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="container hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-badge-row">
          <span class="hero-pill">Antonio David</span>
          <span class="hero-role">// Odoo engineer · AI toolmaker · OCA contributor</span>
          <span class="hero-verified"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> OCA upstream</span>
        </div>

        <h1 id="hero-title">I design solid <mark>Odoo, AI, and OWL</mark> architectures that solve complex problems without friction.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">High-performance engineering for enterprise systems: Odoo modules and migrations, AI-assisted delivery with ODF, and OWL interfaces. Eight years of technical rigor, open source, and no unnecessary dogma.</p>

        <p class="hero-proof"><strong>290</strong> merged PRs <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <strong>10</strong> OCA merges <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <strong>78</strong> reviews <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <strong>1,477</strong> ODF tests</p>
        <p class="hero-note">Public GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Verified 30 Oct 2026 <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Cuba / Remote</p>

        <div class="hero-channels">
          <a class="chip" href="mailto:antoniodavid8@gmail.com"><span aria-hidden="true">✉</span> antoniodavid8@gmail.com</a>
          <a class="chip" href="https://github.com/antoniodavid"><span aria-hidden="true">⌘</span> GitHub</a>
          <a class="chip" href="https://linkedin.com/in/antonio-david-ruban-espinal-921804b9"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span> LinkedIn</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-dark" href="#contact">Let's talk / Hire me <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="button button-light" href="#work">See selected projects <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="focus" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-head">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="section-label">// Specialties</p>
            <h2 id="focus-title">What I do</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-intro">Four work pillars centered on performance, data robustness, and technical simplicity.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="specialty-grid">
          <article class="specialty-card">
            <div class="specialty-top">
              <span class="specialty-tag tag-blue">01 // ERP_BACKEND</span>
              <span class="specialty-icon icon-blue" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3>Odoo Core</h3>
            <p>Modules and migrations from 8 to 19, data models, and integrations that survive real upgrades.</p>
            <ul class="card-tags">
              <li>Odoo 8–19</li>
              <li>Migrations</li>
              <li>OCA</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="specialty-card">
            <div class="specialty-top">
              <span class="specialty-tag tag-purple">02 // AGENTIC_SYSTEMS</span>
              <span class="specialty-icon icon-purple" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l1.8 4.2L18 9l-4.2 1.8L12 15l-1.8-4.2L6 9l4.2-1.8L12 3z"></path><path d="M19 14l.9 2.1L22 17l-2.1.9L19 20l-.9-2.1L16 17l2.1-.9L19 14z"></path></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3>AI &amp; Agents</h3>
            <p>ODF Agent Team: eleven specialist agents, fifty-one skills, policy gates, and 1,477 tests for reviewable AI delivery.</p>
            <ul class="card-tags">
              <li>OpenCode</li>
              <li>11 agents</li>
              <li>1,477 tests</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="specialty-card">
            <div class="specialty-top">
              <span class="specialty-tag tag-coral">03 // MODERN_FRONTEND</span>
              <span class="specialty-icon icon-coral" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 12s3.5-6 10-6 10 6 10 6-3.5 6-10 6S2 12 2 12z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5"></circle></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3>OWL Frontend</h3>
            <p>Hacking OWL: a custom web client and reusable components built on Odoo's OWL framework.</p>
            <ul class="card-tags">
              <li>OWL</li>
              <li>Python</li>
              <li>Apache-2.0</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="specialty-card">
            <div class="specialty-top">
              <span class="specialty-tag tag-green">04 // RELIABILITY</span>
              <span class="specialty-icon icon-green" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 7.5-7 9-4-1.5-7-4.5-7-9V6l7-3z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3>Architecture &amp; Review</h3>
            <p>OCA collaboration: 10 merged changes across 8 repositories and 53 reviews across 26 repositories and 22 authors.</p>
            <ul class="card-tags">
              <li>Code review</li>
              <li>OCA</li>
              <li>10 merges</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-head">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="section-label">// Selected work</p>
            <h2 id="work-title">Selected projects</h2>
          </div>
          <a class="section-link" href="https://github.com/antoniodavid">View all on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </header>

        <article class="flagship">
          <div class="flagship-copy">
            <div class="flagship-top">
              <span class="flag">Flagship</span>
              <span class="badge badge-yellow">1,477 tests passed</span>
            </div>
            <h3>ODF Agent Team — Code orchestrator</h3>
            <p>Multi-agent delivery on OpenCode. Eleven specialist agents, fifty-one skills, policy gates, and 1,477 unit tests, so the work is found instead of invented.</p>
            <ul class="card-tags">
              <li>TypeScript</li>
              <li>OpenCode</li>
              <li>11 agents</li>
              <li>1,477 tests</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="button button-blue" href="https://github.com/antoniodavid/odf-agent-team">Explore repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>

          <div class="terminal" aria-label="ODF proof summary">
            <div class="terminal-bar">
              <span class="terminal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="terminal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="terminal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="terminal-title">odf://proof-summary</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="terminal-body"><code>SPEC      route + context manifest
TESTS     1,477 unit · 331 yaml · 18 harness
RELEASES  10 tagged releases
REVIEW    policy gates + evidence
STATUS    mergeable

290 merged PRs · 79% merge rate</code></pre>
          </div>
        </article>

        <div class="project-grid">
          <article class="project-card project-owl">
            <p class="card-category">OWL / Research</p>
            <h3>Hacking OWL</h3>
            <p>A custom OWL web client and reusable components for people who want to see how the framework fits together.</p>
            <ul class="card-tags">
              <li>9 stars</li>
              <li>Apache-2.0</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/antoniodavid/hacking-owl">View code <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </article>

          <article class="project-card project-oca">
            <p class="card-category">OCA / Upstream</p>
            <h3>OCA modules</h3>
            <p>Ten merged changes across delivery, banking, POS, reporting, website, and localization repositories.</p>
            <ul class="card-tags">
              <li>10 merged</li>
              <li>8 repos</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="card-link" href="#oca">Read the ledger <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          </article>

          <article class="project-card project-odoo">
            <p class="card-category">Odoo / Developer tools</p>
            <h3>odoo.nvim</h3>
            <p>A zero-config Neovim IDE for Odoo 8.0 through 19.0. LSP stubs, Doodba support, and XML→Python navigation.</p>
            <ul class="card-tags">
              <li>Lua</li>
              <li>Neovim</li>
              <li>Odoo 8–19</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/antoniodavid/odoo.nvim">View code <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </article>

          <article class="project-card project-ai">
            <p class="card-category">AI / Terminal</p>
            <h3>OSEM</h3>
            <p>A session manager for OpenCode. SQLite queries 520× faster than parsing the CLI, with fuzzy search and tmux windows.</p>
            <ul class="card-tags">
              <li>Go</li>
              <li>520× faster</li>
              <li>MIT</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/antoniodavid/osem">View code <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </article>

          <article class="project-card project-oca">
            <p class="card-category">Connectivity / Cuba</p>
            <h3>Conecta</h3>
            <p>One CLI for ETECSA portal login, WiFi hotspot sharing, WireGuard VPN, and speed tests.</p>
            <ul class="card-tags">
              <li>Go</li>
              <li>TUI + CLI</li>
              <li>37 commits</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/antoniodavid/conecta">View code <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </article>

          <article class="project-card project-ai">
            <p class="card-category">AI / Omarchy</p>
            <h3>Omarchy Agents</h3>
            <p>A bar panel that watches every AI subscription on the machine and turns usage records into limits and reset times.</p>
            <ul class="card-tags">
              <li>QML</li>
              <li>File watcher</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/antoniodavid/omarchy-agents">View code <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </article>
        </div>

        <details class="more-projects">
          <summary>More experiments <span>5 repos</span></summary>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/antoniodavid/odoodevforge">OdooDevForge</a> — a proof of concept that generates an Odoo module from natural language.</li>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/antoniodavid/owl-app">OWL app</a> — a small to-do application built with OWL.</li>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/antoniodavid/simple">SIMple</a> — an Android app for ETECSA services, GPLv3 and Material You.</li>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/antoniodavid/saldoacuba">SaldoACuba</a> — a PHP service for Cuban mobile balances from 2018.</li>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/antoniodavid/omarchy-workspaces">Omarchy Workspaces</a> — a QML workspace switcher for the Omarchy desktop.</li>
          </ul>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="oca" aria-labelledby="oca-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-head">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="section-label">// Open source</p>
            <h2 id="oca-title">OCA contributions</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-intro"><strong>37</strong> submitted <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <strong>19</strong> repositories <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <strong>10</strong> merged <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <strong>53</strong> reviews. The changes that survived OCA review.</p>
        </header>

        <ul class="oca-ledger" aria-label="Selected OCA pull requests">
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OCA/delivery-carrier/pull/1079">
              <span class="ledger-repo">OCA / delivery-carrier</span>
              <span class="ledger-title">EasyPost carrier integration for Odoo 17</span>
              <span class="ledger-year">2026</span>
              <span class="badge badge-merged">Merged</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OCA/delivery-carrier/pull/1082">
              <span class="ledger-repo">OCA / delivery-carrier</span>
              <span class="ledger-title">EasyPost migration to Odoo 18</span>
              <span class="ledger-year">2026</span>
              <span class="badge badge-merged">Merged</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OCA/bank-statement-import/pull/864">
              <span class="ledger-repo">OCA / bank-statement-import</span>
              <span class="ledger-title">Plaid statement import migration to 18.0</span>
              <span class="ledger-year">2025</span>
              <span class="badge badge-merged">Merged</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OCA/reporting-engine/pull/969">
              <span class="ledger-repo">OCA / reporting-engine</span>
              <span class="ledger-title">Spreadsheet dashboard migration for bi_view_editor</span>
              <span class="ledger-year">2025</span>
              <span class="badge badge-merged">Merged</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OCA/reporting-engine/pull/968">
              <span class="ledger-repo">OCA / reporting-engine</span>
              <span class="ledger-title">bi_view_editor migration to 17.0</span>
              <span class="ledger-year">2025</span>
              <span class="badge badge-merged">Merged</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OCA/stock-logistics-reporting/pull/404">
              <span class="ledger-repo">OCA / stock-logistics-reporting</span>
              <span class="ledger-title">Valued picking report configuration</span>
              <span class="ledger-year">2025</span>
              <span class="badge badge-merged">Merged</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OCA/pos/pull/1309">
              <span class="ledger-repo">OCA / pos</span>
              <span class="ledger-title">pos_margin migration to 17.0</span>
              <span class="ledger-year">2025</span>
              <span class="badge badge-merged">Merged</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OCA/website/pull/1095">
              <span class="ledger-repo">OCA / website</span>
              <span class="ledger-title">website_local_font migration to 17.0</span>
              <span class="ledger-year">2025</span>
              <span class="badge badge-merged">Merged</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OCA/l10n-spain/pull/4083">
              <span class="ledger-repo">OCA / l10n-spain</span>
              <span class="ledger-title">IGIC accounts 112 and 113</span>
              <span class="ledger-year">2025</span>
              <span class="badge badge-merged">Merged</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OCA/partner-contact/pull/1728">
              <span class="ledger-repo">OCA / partner-contact</span>
              <span class="ledger-title">partner_country_lang migration to 14.0</span>
              <span class="ledger-year">2024</span>
              <span class="badge badge-merged">Merged</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="ledger-open">
            <a href="https://github.com/OCA/l10n-usa/pull/166">
              <span class="ledger-repo">OCA / l10n-usa</span>
              <span class="ledger-title">Bill.com two-way integration</span>
              <span class="ledger-year">Open</span>
              <span class="badge badge-open">Open for review</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="oca-note">
          <p><strong>Teamwork, in public.</strong> 78 pull requests reviewed across 34 repositories and 28 authors. 53 of those reviews are in OCA, across 26 repositories and 22 authors.</p>
          <p class="source-line">Verified from public GitHub search on 30 October 2026.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="method" aria-labelledby="method-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-head">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="section-label">// Approach</p>
            <h2 id="method-title">How I approach each project</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-intro">The interesting question is not whether the code compiles. It is whether the next person can trust it, change it, and ship it on a Friday.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="approach-grid">
          <article class="approach-card method-blue">
            <span class="approach-index">01</span>
            <h3>Specification</h3>
            <p>ODF starts with a route, a context manifest, and a gate. The goal is the right change, not the first change.</p>
            <p class="approach-evidence">11 agents · 51 skills · policy gates</p>
          </article>
          <article class="approach-card method-green">
            <span class="approach-index">02</span>
            <h3>Testing</h3>
            <p>1,477 unit tests, 331 YAML tests, and 18 harness tests in ODF. This page ships with its own regression suite.</p>
            <p class="approach-evidence">TDD · 10 tagged releases</p>
          </article>
          <article class="approach-card method-coral">
            <span class="approach-index">03</span>
            <h3>Review</h3>
            <p>78 pull requests reviewed across 34 repositories and 28 authors. 53 of those reviews are in OCA, across 26 repositories.</p>
            <p class="approach-evidence">53 OCA reviews</p>
          </article>
          <article class="approach-card method-purple">
            <span class="approach-index">04</span>
            <h3>Delivery</h3>
            <p>Small, reviewable changes, Conventional Commits, tagged releases, and docs that tell the next person where the seams are.</p>
            <p class="approach-evidence">MIT · changelog · docs</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section contact-section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="contact-card">
          <p class="contact-badge"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Open to contracts &amp; technical consulting</p>
          <h2 id="contact-title">Have a complex Odoo, AI, or architecture problem?</h2>
          <p class="contact-copy">Available for development sprints, architecture consulting, performance audits, and custom enterprise modules. If the problem spans modules, versions, or teams, that is the interesting part.</p>
          <div class="contact-actions">
            <a class="chip chip-dark" href="mailto:antoniodavid8@gmail.com"><span aria-hidden="true">✉</span> antoniodavid8@gmail.com</a>
            <a class="chip chip-dark" href="https://github.com/antoniodavid"><span aria-hidden="true">⌘</span> GitHub</a>
            <a class="chip chip-dark" href="https://linkedin.com/in/antonio-david-ruban-espinal-921804b9"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span> LinkedIn</a>
          </div>
          <p class="contact-meta">English / Español <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Based in Cuba <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Working worldwide</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
